                     LANDS OF ZARAST--INSTRUCTIONS
  
      LANDS OF ZARAST IS AN ADVENTURE GAME THAT I AM WRITING.
YOU CAN TRY IT IF YOU LIKE.

BEFORE YOU CAN PLAY THIS GAME YOU MUST GENERATE A DATA FILE
CALLED 'NEWADV.DAT' YOU CAN RECIEVE ONE OF THESE BY RUNNING
THE PROGRAM CALLED 'FILER.SHR'.ALSO WHEN THE GAME IS RUN AND PLAYED,
IT WILL CREATE ANOTHER DATA FILE CALLED,'SCENAR.IO' THIS IS
YOUR PERSONAL SCENARIO FILE,IF YOU WANT TO RENEW YOUR
SCENARIO THEN JUST DELETE THIS FILE,NEVER DELETE NEWADV.DAT
BECAUSE THIS HAS BASIC DATA ON PLAY OF THE GAME.

        THIS ADVENTURE GAME IS BASED ON D&D TYPE GAMES,
IT INCLUDES FEATURES SUCH AS , COMBAT,SPELL CASTING,SPECIAL
ABILITIES,"INTELLIGENT" MONSTERS,ETC...
JUST PLAY THIS GAME AS YOU WOULD ANY OTHER ADVENTURE GAME,AND
TRY TO DISCOVER TREASURE,EXPERIENCE,ETC...

CHARACTERS ARE CREATED BY RUNNING A FILE CALLED CHARAC.SHR,
OR A FASTER WAY IS CHARC.SHR.JUST ANSWER THE QUESTIONS AND IT
WILL DO ALL THE WORK.

HINTS......

THIEVES CAN USE SPECIAL ABILITIES SUCH AS:

CLIMB WALL(S)
PICK POCKETS (OF MONSTERS WITH MONEY)
BACKSTABBING (YOU MUST BE ON A WALL WITH A WEAPON DRAWN,TO DO THIS)
(???????????) (OTHER STUFF WHICH YOU MIGHT DISCOVER)

MAGIC-USER ARE VERY WEAK EXCEPT WHEN IT COMES TO SPELL CASTING,
TO DO THIS YOU TYPE-
]CAST SPELL  (THEN THE GAME WILL RESPOND-)
WHICH SPELL WOULD YOU LIKE TO CAST?
:(THEN YOU TYPE THE SPELL YOU WANT TO CAST)

         IF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS,SEND MAIL TO STAFFORD.

                SAURON THE FEARED
/X
P.S TO SEE WHAT YOUR CHARACTER LOOKS LIKE WHILE PLAYING THE GAME
TYPE IN THE COMMAND *STATUS

P.S.S ALSO,WHEN YOU GENERATE CHARACTERS WHEN YOU NAME THEM YOU MUST
USE NAMES UNDER 7 CHARACTERS LONG WITH NO SPACES USING ONLY
ALPHANUMERIC CHARACTERS (LETTERS A-Z AND/OR NUMBERS 0-9)
